  "rung": 5,
  "name": "Factory",
  "_comment": [
    "For the orchestrator: optional config keys read at run time from .harness/config.json on the default branch (no install-time substitution):",
    "  max_open_agent_prs (integer, default 3): work-in-progress limit; agent-implement.yml will not claim a new issue while this many agent:authored PRs are open.",
    "  max_fix_attempts (integer, default 2): stall rule in .harness/prompts/implement.md.",
    "Repository variable AGENT_CI_WORKFLOW (human sets it): CI workflow file name dispatched on the agent branch, because PRs opened with GITHUB_TOKEN start no workflows.",
    "Workflow entries carry \"agent\": \"claude\" (adapter; only the marked AGENT STEP is vendor-specific).",
    "Depends on rung 4 files: .harness/bin/agent-output.py, strip-hidden.py, maintainers.txt, triage-labels.txt."
